text.paragraph:
                   Actives:tobramycin 3 mg (0.3%) and dexamethasone 1 mg (0.1%);

Inactives:edetate disodium, hydroxyethyl cellulose, purified water, sodium chloride, sodium sulfate, and tyloxapol. Sulfuric acid and/or sodium hydroxide may be added to adjust pH (5.0 – 6.0).

Preservative:benzalkonium chloride 0.01%.
